ime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA487815DA6ED5E44","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"비열한 마법사... 감히 기습을 하다니!","female":"비열한 마법사... 감히 기습을 하다니!","variant_male_record_index":"188872","variant_female_record_index":"188873","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1523506005:0":{"text":"아반드... 아반드!","source_cn":"阿邦德……阿邦德！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA32F58E43CE583DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1523506006:0":{"text":"내가 없으면 너를 거스를 사람이 없을 테니 편하게 영주 자리를 지킬 수 있을 거라고 생각하나?","source_cn":"你以为没有我，就不会有其他人反抗你，你就能安安稳稳地坐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x677D9F3887FF5FB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1523506007:0":{"text":"군대를 이끄는 방법은 아는지 모르겠군. 루나애니를 죽이는 법은 아나? 아니! 넌 아무것도 모르는 어린애야. 그런 너에게 영주의 자리가 어울릴 리가 없지!","source_cn":"你懂怎么带领军队吗？你知道怎么杀死兽人吗？不！你只是一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA56D81CE5716BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1523506008:1":{"text":"당신...!","source_cn":"你——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x189960D882409492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1523506009:1":{"text":"그런 날은 오지 않아요.","source_cn":"不会有那一天的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27BC14ED2ED9AC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1523506010:1":{"text":"당신은 보칼리스 백성들이 원하는 것을 모르죠. 하지만 저는 알아요.","source_cn":"你不知道呼临城的大家想要什么，但我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81DDFB7240FDCA2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1523506011:1":{"text":"저는 모두가 바라는 것을 이루기 위해, 보칼리스 백성들이 행복하게 살 수 있도록 최선을 다할 겁니다.","source_cn":"我会尽我所能，给大家想要的，让呼临的民众都过上好日子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB62EDDB6CE14820E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1523506012:1":{"text":"그러니까, 그런 날은 오지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"所以，不会有你说的那一天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB42D1752F07CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1523506013:1":{"text":"아반드 님...","source_cn":"阿邦德殿下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E941957DA9432DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1523506014:1":{"text":"...오울러! 당신은 거짓말로 군대를 동원해 반란을 일으켰고, 무고한 학자를 인질로 잡아 새로운 작물을 찾는 보칼리스의 계획을 방해했습니다.","source_cn":"——奥勒留！你说谎，让军队反叛；又伤害无辜的学者，妨碍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB621E92D9FB820DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1523506015:1":{"text":"그러니 그 반역죄를 묻기 위해... 오울러를 당장 감옥에 가두도록!","source_cn":"因此——我判你犯谋逆罪，立刻投牢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04039225F9B47A3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1523506016:1":{"text":"처벌은... 음, 나중에 결정하지! 지금은 씀바귀 이삭이 가장 중요하니까.","source_cn":"至于怎么处理……呃，之后再说！现在苦苞穗的事最重要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x951E640F36528084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1523506017:1":{"text":"호위, 오울러를 감옥에 가두고 사흘간 아무것도 주지 말도록 해. 가장 밑바닥의 백성들이 겪는 굶주림의 고통을 느껴봐야 하니까.","source_cn":"护卫，把他关进牢里。三天不许给他吃的，让他也尝尝饥荒时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3C2B1CC99346D35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1523506018:1":{"text":"네!","source_cn":"是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x214B58C9911E5151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1523506019:0":{"text":"어때요, 저 멋있었죠?","source_cn":"怎么样，我是不是很有魄力？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x297B5E0E93913BC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1523506020:0":{"text":"아반드 님... 드디어 성장하셨군요.","source_cn":"殿下……您终于长大了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEFAC94BE991145F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1523506021:1":{"text":"당연하죠. 영주가 된 지도 꽤 됐잖아요. 이젠 조금 나아져야죠.","source_cn":"当然，我都当领主这么久了，总该有点长进嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ED52CED9F30D936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1523506022:1":{"text":"아, 맞아. 일단 <style=\"highlight\">그 학자를 달래주러 가요</style>. 분명 많이 놀랐을 거예요!","source_cn":"哦对了，我们先去<style=highlight>安抚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA391E727D7EEF6B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1523506023:1":{"text":"네, 확실히 저희 잘못이지요. 사과를 해야겠습니다.","source_cn":"嗯，这的确是我们的过失，理应向她赔礼道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E615140325F53E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"그래서 네가 뭘 할 수 있는데","source_cn":"彼此彼此","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x85A6757DC2BAB001","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래서 네가 뭘 할 수 있는데","female":"그래서 네가 뭘 할 수 있는데","variant_male_record_index":"79147","variant_female_record_index":"79148","document_title":"","document_